 /*
- * DeltaESC-G30D v0.6 sensorless control core.
+ * DeltaESC-G30D v0.7.1 ST-Link sensorless bench core.
  *
- * Observer structure is adapted from EBiCS Sensorless_VESC / VESC-style
- * nonlinear flux observer work. Default R/L/flux constants remain provisional
- * until G30D hardware identification is validated. Runtime app settings for
- * physical R/L/flux are therefore telemetry/configuration only in v0.6.
+ * The old v0.6 core had three practical startup defects: the Q15 PI gains
+ * quantized almost every useful error to zero, the observer beta sign was
+ * mirrored relative to the Clarke/Park convention, and the observer started
+ * from an unseeded zero-flux state. This revision uses a current-count-domain
+ * PI and a discrete Mxlemming flux observer, seeded by the alignment phase.
+ *
+ * R/L/flux defaults are deliberately conservative generic hub-motor values.
+ * They are runtime replaceable and MUST later be measured on the actual motor.
